{"page":556,"verses":[{"verse_key":"64:1","surah":64,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" يُسَبِّحُ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ لَهُ ٱلْمُلْكُ وَلَهُ ٱلْحَمْدُ ۖ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everything that is in the heavens and earth glorifies God; all control and all praise belong to Him; He has power over everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُسَبِّحُ","en_gloss":"Glorifies","transliteration":"yusabbiḥu","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"[to] Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُ","en_gloss":"For Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمُلْكُ","en_gloss":"(is the) dominion","transliteration":"l-mul'ku","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَهُ","en_gloss":"and for Him","transliteration":"walahu","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) the praise","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":16,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":17,"ar":"قَدِيرٌ","en_gloss":"All-Powerful","transliteration":"qadīrun","verse_key":"64:1"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"64:1"}]},{"verse_key":"64:2","surah":64,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكُمْ فَمِنكُمْ كَافِرٌ وَمِنكُم مُّؤْمِنٌ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who created you, yet some of you disbelieve and some believe: God sees everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَلَقَكُمْ","en_gloss":"created you","transliteration":"khalaqakum","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَمِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"and among you","transliteration":"faminkum","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَافِرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a disbeliever","transliteration":"kāfirun","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمِنكُم","en_gloss":"and among you","transliteration":"waminkum","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُّؤْمِنٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) a believer","transliteration":"mu'minun","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَصِيرٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"64:2"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"64:2"}]},{"verse_key":"64:3","surah":64,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَصَوَّرَكُمْ فَأَحْسَنَ صُوَرَكُمْ ۖ وَإِلَيْهِ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He created the heavens and earth for a true purpose; He formed you and made your forms good: you will all return to Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"He created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"with truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَصَوَّرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and He formed you","transliteration":"waṣawwarakum","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"and made good","transliteration":"fa-aḥsana","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"صُوَرَكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your forms","transliteration":"ṣuwarakum","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"and to Him","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_gloss":"(is) the final return","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","verse_key":"64:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"64:3"}]},{"verse_key":"64:4","surah":64,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَيَعْلَمُ مَا تُسِرُّونَ وَمَا تُعْلِنُونَ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He knows what is in the heavens and earth; He knows what you conceal and what you reveal; God knows very well the secrets of every heart.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"He knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"and He knows","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُسِرُّونَ","en_gloss":"you conceal","transliteration":"tusirrūna","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تُعْلِنُونَ ۚ","en_gloss":"you declare","transliteration":"tuʿ'linūna","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِذَاتِ","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bidhāti","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_gloss":"(is in) the breasts","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","verse_key":"64:4"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٤","en_gloss":"(4)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"64:4"}]},{"verse_key":"64:5","surah":64,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ يَأْتِكُمْ نَبَؤُا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِن قَبْلُ فَذَاقُوا۟ وَبَالَ أَمْرِهِمْ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Disbelievers], have you not heard about those who disbelieved before you? They tasted the evil consequences of their conduct, and a painful torment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Has not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَأْتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"come to you","transliteration":"yatikum","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَبَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"(the) news","transliteration":"naba-u","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَذَاقُوا۟","en_gloss":"So they tasted","transliteration":"fadhāqū","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَبَالَ","en_gloss":"(the bad) consequence","transliteration":"wabāla","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَمْرِهِمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their affair","transliteration":"amrihim","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmun","verse_key":"64:5"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"64:5"}]},{"verse_key":"64:6","surah":64,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُۥ كَانَت تَّأْتِيهِمْ رُسُلُهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَقَالُوٓا۟ أَبَشَرٌ يَهْدُونَنَا فَكَفَرُوا۟ وَتَوَلَّوا۟ ۚ وَّٱسْتَغْنَى ٱللَّهُ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ غَنِىٌّ حَمِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"That is because their messengers came to them with clear signs, yet they said, ‘Should we take guidance from mere mortals?’, rejected the message, and turned away. But God had no need for them: He is all sufficient, worthy of all praise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"(is) because","transliteration":"bi-annahu","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَانَت","en_gloss":"had","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَّأْتِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"come to them","transliteration":"tatīhim","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رُسُلُهُم","en_gloss":"their Messengers","transliteration":"rusuluhum","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with clear proofs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"but they said","transliteration":"faqālū","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَبَشَرٌۭ","en_gloss":"Shall human beings","transliteration":"abasharun","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَهْدُونَنَا","en_gloss":"guide us","transliteration":"yahdūnanā","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَكَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"So they disbelieved","transliteration":"fakafarū","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَتَوَلَّوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"and turned away","transliteration":"watawallaw","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَّٱسْتَغْنَى","en_gloss":"And can do without them","transliteration":"wa-is'taghnā","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":15,"ar":"غَنِىٌّ","en_gloss":"(is) Self-sufficient","transliteration":"ghaniyyun","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":16,"ar":"حَمِيدٌۭ","en_gloss":"Praiseworthy","transliteration":"ḥamīdun","verse_key":"64:6"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"64:6"}]},{"verse_key":"64:7","surah":64,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"زَعَمَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ أَن لَّن يُبْعَثُوا۟ ۚ قُلْ بَلَىٰ وَرَبِّى لَتُبْعَثُنَّ ثُمَّ لَتُنَبَّؤُنَّ بِمَا عَمِلْتُمْ ۚ وَذَٰلِكَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ يَسِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The disbelievers claim they will not be raised from the dead. Say [Prophet], ‘Yes indeed! I swear by my Lord! You will be raised and then you will be informed about everything you have done: an easy matter for God.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"زَعَمَ","en_gloss":"Claim","transliteration":"zaʿama","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَّن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُبْعَثُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"will they be raised","transliteration":"yub'ʿathū","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"Yes","transliteration":"balā","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَرَبِّى","en_gloss":"by my Lord","transliteration":"warabbī","verse_key":"64:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَتُبْعَثُنَّ","en_gloss":"surely you will be raised","translit